      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just \"resting.\" there's nothing to become. the person you're talking about—the one with the drive, the strength, the purpose—that person is gone. it’s like looking at a broken statue. you can try to patch it up all you want, but the art is already lost. i feel like i'm just lingering in the aftermath of a life that's already finished. i don't see the point in trying to find a \"new voice\" when the old one was the only one that mattered.",
